  "StockRole": "Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Gryphon, built from an improved Hellbringer chassis, is Clan Stone Lion’s durable heavy OmniMech. It features thick Ferro-Lamellor armor—nearly double that of its predecessor—25.5 tons of pod space, and a supercharged 325 XL engine with 10 double heat sinks. Though slightly lighter than the Hellbringer, it delivers strong protection and firepower, reaching speeds over 100 kph briefly. Manufactured mainly on Niles, the Gryphon is agile and tough, with five flexible variants and the unique ability to carry Battle Armored troops into combat, making it a key unit in Clan Stone Lion’s touman.",
